# budget from 400-unreachable-terminator-branch.ref: the course solution's count, widened by 10% and rounded up, plus one, and at least three more than the count
instructions <= 9
blocks <= 8
count(call) <= 4
count(load) <= 3
count(store) <= 3
count(phi) <= 3
instructions <= 4 in @drop_guard
instructions <= 7 in @keep_ordinary_call
instructions <= 4 in @main
